WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.769
Swarm splits a check into slices and gives each
child the same rule for reporting its result.

2
00:00:06.769 --> 00:00:09.440
The children here use scripted replies.

3
00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.780
The first report has the
plain greeting result,

4
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.842
but the required shout
slice has no result.

5
00:00:16.842 --> 00:00:19.050
Swarm marks the job incomplete.

6
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.393
Pi runs that slice again and
aggregates the returned verdict.

7
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:38.857
You can see which checks
are accounted for.

8
00:00:38.857 --> 00:00:44.093
Once both required slices pass on the
same commit, the overall report passes.
